# Diamond Rush skill on every prompt

At the start of every new prompt in this project, before planning or editing anything, read [`.cursor/skills/diamond-rush-mobile-ui/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/diamond-rush-mobile-ui/SKILL.md) and follow it.

- If the prompt touches gameplay, levels, art assets, sprite sheets, the camera, builders, or verification, also read [`.cursor/skills/diamond-rush-mobile-ui/gameplay-pipeline.md`](.cursor/skills/diamond-rush-mobile-ui/gameplay-pipeline.md) and work through its checklist.
- Use the skill's scripts (`scripts/compile_check.sh`, `scripts/serve_preview.mjs`, `scripts/decode_cdp_screenshot.mjs`) instead of rewriting those steps.
- If the work uncovers a new procedure or trap, add it to the skill before finishing.
- Conflict order stays as in `game-prd.mdc`: the PRD wins on product and mechanics; the skill wins on canvas, hit targets, and layout.
